            {
              "cards": [
                {
                  "content": "<details open><summary><ha-icon icon=\"mdi:airplane-alert\"></ha-icon> <b>Charters and unusual A330 flying (CrewTrac, next 30 days)</b> &middot; {{ states('sensor.flight_watcher_charters') }}</summary>{{ '\\n\\n' }}{%- set items = state_attr('sensor.flight_watcher_charters', 'items') or [] -%}\n{%- set st = state_attr('sensor.flight_watcher_charters', 'status') or '' -%}\n{%- set ls = state_attr('sensor.flight_watcher_charters', 'last_scan') or '' -%}\n{%- if st.startswith('not configured') -%}\n<ha-alert alert-type=\"info\">CrewTrac not configured yet: set ctweb_username (employee number) and ctweb_password in Settings > Apps > Flight Watcher > Configuration.</ha-alert>\n{%- elif st and not st.startswith('ok') -%}\n<ha-alert alert-type=\"warning\">{{ st }}</ha-alert>\n{%- endif %}\n{%- if items | count == 0 %}\nNo unusual A330 flying found{{ ' (scanned ' ~ (as_datetime(ls) | as_local).strftime('%b %-d %H:%M') ~ ')' if ls else '' }}.\n{%- else %}\n| Date | Flight | Route | Scheduled (local) | Eqpt | Tail | Why | Seen |\n|:--|:--|:--|:--|:--|:--|:--|:--|\n{%- for r in items %}\n{%- set act = r.actual | default('', true) | trim -%}\n{%- set st = ' &#10004;' if act is search('\\\\d\\\\d:\\\\d\\\\d-\\\\d\\\\d:\\\\d\\\\d') else (' &#9992;' if act is search('\\\\d\\\\d:\\\\d\\\\d-\\\\s*$') else '') %}\n| {{ '~~' if r.gone else '' }}{{ r.date }}{{ '~~' if r.gone else '' }} | **{{ r.flight }}** | **{{ r.route }}**{{ st }} | {{ r.scheduled }} | {{ r.eqpt }} | {{ r.tail }} | {{ r.why }} | {{ r.first_seen }} |\n{%- endfor %}\n\n<sub>Last scan {{ (as_datetime(ls) | as_local).strftime('%b %-d %H:%M') if ls else 'never' }}; {{ st }}. Struck through = no longer on the schedule.</sub>\n{%- endif %}\n\n<details><summary>&#9656; Key</summary>\n\n<sub>\n\n- Source: CrewTrac Web > Options > Scheduled Service, HNL departures and arrivals, one date at a time, every 6 h (read only)\n- Flagged: A330 (332/333) flights numbered 99xx, or whose other end is not a regular A330 station (list in the app Configuration, charter_regular)\n- Each newly seen flight pushes once, as a critical alert, to iPhone 16 and Ryan's iPhone (automation Flight Watcher charter; replaces Hark's daily charter scan)\n- &#10004; after the route = flown (CrewTrac shows actual out and in); &#9992; = airborne now (actual out, no in yet)\n\n</sub>{{ '\\n\\n' }}</details>\n\n</details>",
